  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: 'You signed. You ate Company bread on the road and wore Company boots, and that''s debt. You work it off here, at whatever we put in your hands, or you go under the quarry with the rest of the ones who didn''t.'
